+---
+id: task-002-record-task-createdat-and-updatedat
+type: task
+title: "Record task createdAt and updatedAt"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+# Record task createdAt and updatedAt
+
+Request: record when each task was created and last changed.
+
+- Every task has `createdAt` and `updatedAt`, ISO-8601 date-time strings; equal when the task is added.
+- Completing, reopening, renaming, tagging or untagging a task sets `updatedAt` to the time of the change.
+- The domain does not read the clock (r3): the list takes a clock function; `createTodoList` supplies the real one.
